shelf-json-error = Could not serialize the shelf JSON document.
shelf-error-repository = Could not read the Git repository.
shelf-error-command = The Git operation did not complete. Check eska status and retained shelves with eska shelves.
shelf-error-io = Could not read or write the shelf. Check file permissions and free space; retained data is available through eska shelves.
shelf-error-invalid-shelf = The shelf is damaged or contains unsupported data. Automatic restoration stopped; the original shelf data was retained.
shelf-error-locked = Another operation is using the repository. Retry after it finishes.
shelf-error-detached = Shelves require an active local branch. Leave detached HEAD using Git first.
shelf-error-unborn = Create the first commit with eska save before using shelves.
shelf-error-in-progress = Complete the current merge/rebase operation or resolve conflicts before using shelves.
shelf-error-unsupported-index = Shelves do not support this index: conflicts, sparse/split index, submodules, intent-to-add, skip-worktree or assume-unchanged may be present. Restore an ordinary index using Git first.
shelf-error-empty = No changes to save to a shelf.
shelf-error-shelf-exists = This branch already has a shelf. Check eska shelves and restore it with eska unshelve before saving again.
shelf-error-shelf-missing = Shelf not found. Check the list with eska shelves.
shelf-error-wrong-branch = The shelf belongs to another branch. Return to its original branch before restoring it.
shelf-error-moved-branch = The branch moved after this shelf was created. The shelf was retained; inspect its original commit with eska shelves --format json and return the branch to that commit using Git before restoring it.
shelf-error-dirty = The working copy conflicts with restoration. Preserve current changes separately before running eska unshelve; the shelf was retained.
shelf-error-collision = Path { $path } prevents restoration. Move the conflicting file and retry eska unshelve; the shelf was retained.
shelf-error-incomplete = The shelf operation did not complete. Original data remains in the Git directory under eska-shelves. Check eska shelves; retain the shelf until its index and files have been recovered.
